00:34:42.980 --> 00:34:43.300
Okay.
好的。

824
00:34:44.080 --> 00:34:45.980
Well, I don't know if you noticed this.
嗯，不知道你们有没有注意到这个。

825
00:34:45.980 --> 00:34:53.460
I did not notice it at first, but luckily, Floor H wrote in to say, there are two television
我起初没注意到，但幸运的是，Floor H 写信来说，迈克尔的公寓里有两台电视机。

