他从小就踢球。

855
00:36:05.680 --> 00:36:08.400
He like played on like a soccer league on the weekend.
他周末会参加那种足球联赛之类的。

856
00:36:08.660 --> 00:36:11.060
So he actually knew a lot about soccer.
所以他其实很懂足球。

857
00:36:11.280 --> 00:36:12.240
Well, he's British.
毕竟他是英国人。

858
00:36:12.760 --> 00:36:13.160
Football.
足球。

859
00:36:13.480 --> 00:36:13.880
Football.
足球。

860
00:36:14.100 --> 00:36:14.280
Yes.
没错。

861
