Jim has this talking head about how he's just never been a kiss-up, you know?
吉姆有个访谈片段，说他从来都不是那种会拍马屁的人，你知道吧？

864
00:36:20.000 --> 00:36:21.860
That's just not how he operates.
那不是他的行事风格。

865
00:36:21.860 --> 00:36:22.400
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

