There's this moment where he's like, I'm not going to do it.
然后他还是屈服了，说，是啊，我是个球员。

886
00:37:21.620 --> 00:37:22.280
I'm not going to do it.
德怀特简直高兴坏了。

887
00:37:22.360 --> 00:37:25.900
And then he just succumbs and was like, yeah, I'm a player.
他说，哦，真的吗，吉姆？

888
00:37:27.020 --> 00:37:30.320
