00:37:57.840 --> 00:37:59.640
Well, now Jim's going to be in a big pickle.
他当时在橙队。

899
00:37:59.640 --> 00:38:03.100
He said he played soccer from second to fourth grade.
是啊。

900
00:38:03.100 --> 00:38:04.780
He was on the orange team.
确实。

901
00:38:05.000 --> 00:38:06.000
I love that talking head.
我很喜欢那个采访镜头。

902
00:38:06.080 --> 00:38:06.580
I do, too.
我也是。

903
00:38:06.740 --> 00:38:07.880
It made me laugh.
它把我逗笑了。

904
00:38:08.140 --> 00:38:12.960
Well, listen, I think we should take a break because in the second half of the episode,
好了，听着，我觉得我们该休息一下，因为在这一集的后半部分，

