00:38:18.840 --> 00:38:19.660
soccer promise.
足球承诺。

907
00:38:19.660 --> 00:38:20.580
It's good stuff.
那段很精彩。

908
00:38:20.880 --> 00:38:21.320
All right.
好的。

909
00:38:31.200 --> 00:38:32.200
We are back.
我们回来了。

910
00:38:32.200 --> 00:38:34.940
And you guys, the dream team got Vikram.
伙计们，梦之队把维克拉姆拉进来了。

911
00:38:35.120 --> 00:38:35.800
