我们搞定他了。

912
00:38:35.800 --> 00:38:39.940
Vikram, played by the awesome Ranjit Chowdhury.
维克拉姆由了不起的兰吉特·乔杜里饰演。

913
00:38:40.120 --> 00:38:41.580
He was so fun to work with.
和他合作非常愉快。

914
00:38:41.740 --> 00:38:43.260
You know, he passed away last year.
你知道，他去年去世了。

915
00:38:43.340 --> 00:38:43.760
I know.
我知道。

916
00:38:44.040 --> 00:38:45.060
He was so funny.
他真的很有趣。

917
00:38:45.420 --> 00:38:48.760
We're in the car and, you know, Michael's all excited.
我们在车里，你知道，迈克尔非常兴奋。

918
00:38:49.260 --> 00:38:50.940
They pull up to the bowling alley.
他们把车开到了保龄球馆。

919
00:38:51.080 --> 00:38:52.720
Michael's like, I have to use the bathroom.
迈克尔说，我得去趟洗手间。

920
00:38:53.260 --> 00:38:55.040
And Vikram has this line.
然后维克拉姆说了这句台词。

921
00:38:55.340 --> 00:38:58.560
It's so good where he says, confidence.
太棒了，他说，自信，

922
00:38:58.820 --> 00:39:01.800
It's the food of the wise man, but the liquor of the fool.
是智者的食粮，却是愚者的烈酒。

923
00:39:01.800 --> 00:39:05.200
Well, I was so struck by this when I watched this episode.
看这一集的时候，我被这句话深深触动了。

924
00:39:05.360 --> 00:39:05.760
Me too.
我也是。

925
00:39:06.140 --> 00:39:12.480
So I Googled it because I thought, is that like an old, I don't know, expression, proverb,
所以我去谷歌了一下，因为我在想，这会不会是什么古老的，我不知道，表达方式、谚语，

926
00:39:12.760 --> 00:39:14.320
like a Greek philosopher?
比如出自哪位希腊哲学家？

927
00:39:14.880 --> 00:39:15.440
No.
并没有。

928
00:39:15.680 --> 00:39:16.560
It's nowhere.
哪儿都找不到。

929
00:39:16.880 --> 00:39:21.620
There are Reddit threads dedicated to trying to figure out where this line came from.
Reddit上甚至有专门的帖子在讨论这句话的出处。

930
00:39:21.760 --> 00:39:24.720
There was an article written about this one line.
还有人专门为这一句台词写过文章。

931
00:39:24.780 --> 00:39:25.280
You're kidding.
你开玩笑吧。

932
00:39:25.280 --> 00:39:30.220
And how wise it is and how the writer of the article couldn't find its origin either.
文章里说这句话多有哲理，而且作者也找不到它的来源。

933
00:39:31.340 --> 00:39:34.260
Someone on our writing staff wrote that line.
是我们编剧组的某个人写的。

934
00:39:34.440 --> 00:39:35.540
And we don't know who?
但我们不知道是谁？

935
00:39:35.840 --> 00:39:36.960
I asked BJ.
我问了BJ。

936
00:39:37.240 --> 00:39:38.220
I asked Mindy.
我问了敏迪。

937
00:39:38.340 --> 00:39:39.480
I asked Aaron Schur.
我问了亚伦·舒尔。

938
00:39:39.720 --> 00:39:41.660
No one can take credit for it.
没人承认是自己写的。

939
00:39:42.000 --> 00:39:44.220
Aaron Schur said something that I really liked.
亚伦·舒尔说了一句我很喜欢的话。

940
00:39:44.400 --> 00:39:46.220
